     1	"""SOTA sprint screening runner: paired synthetic (or cached real) streams x chosen policies.
     2	
     3	Synthetic seed ``s`` of regime ``R`` draws one loss stream from
     4	``SeedSequence([seed_base, sha(R_base), s])``; every policy replays that stream with its own
     5	private generator, so all comparisons are paired. A ``@B<n>`` regime suffix changes the hard budget.
     6	
     7	    uv run python scripts/sota_sprint/screen.py --regimes F0_better,F0_null \
     8	        --policies QSG,xu_acquisition_only --seeds 20 --out outputs/sota_sprint/screen/demo
     9	"""
