  * (iii) false promotion on the iid nulls V_null and V_worse, plus V_null_dep_r5, from 1000 fresh seeds.
* Seeds: synthetic 100 at base 2026110608; nulls 1000 at base 2026110609; fresh real data at 20 seeds,
